  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: (4 × 12 + 15) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 12 and 15**\n\nGiven: (4 × 12 + 15) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**4 × 15**__ + 12) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ (__**60**____** + 12**__) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ __**72**____** ÷ 8**__ – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ __9 - 9__ = 0\n\n⇒ **0 = 0**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 4 and 8\n\nGiven: (4 × 12 + 15) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**8 × 12**__ + 15) ÷ 4 – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ (**__96__**__** + 15**__) ÷ 4 – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ __**111 ÷ 4**__ – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ __**27.75**____** – 9**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 18.75 ≠ 0\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 12 and 8\n\nGiven: (4 × 12 + 15) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**4 × 8**__ + 15) ÷ 12 – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ (__**32 **____**+ 15**__) ÷ 12 – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ **__47__**__** ÷ 12**__ – 9 = 0\n\n⇒ __3.92 - 9__ = 0\n\n⇒ - 5.08 ≠ 0\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 8 and 9\n\nGiven: (4 × 12 + 15) ÷ 8 – 9 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**4 × 12**__ + 15) ÷ 9 – 8 = 0\n\n⇒ (__48____** + 15**__) ÷ 9 – 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**63 ÷ 9**__ – 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __7 - 8__ = 0\n\n⇒ - 1 ≠ 0\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
